{"games":[{"id":13158116555,"name":"Gearworks","desc":"Welcome to Gearworks — a mechanical engineering and computer science sandbox. \n\nGearworks is a non-profit complete remaster of Defaultio's \"Metalworks Sandbox Demo\" with the sole intention of expanding upon his original concept. It's important to note that this project is a solo endeavor and is still under ongoing development. With that being said, there's still a lot more to come, including new components, features, gameplay enhancements, and even a new map.","path":"/game/13158116555-gearworks","slug":"13158116555-gearworks","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bdca60cb48cf76c91008fef45cb155ce/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5f052ab3688ec8d011f3910132eef2b1/150/150/Image/Jpeg/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":9,"visitor":942970,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-04-06T12:56:43.826Z","creator":{"name":"nxum","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":45659278,"name":"PARTY.exe","desc":"","path":"/game/45659278-party-exe","slug":"45659278-party-exe","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0e38f156d98eb9095dc7c652caf2afcb/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":8,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":434010118,"name":"Book of Monsters","desc":"","path":"/game/434010118-book-of-monsters","slug":"434010118-book-of-monsters","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d1614ebfa7d0df812d4127ad9d64d74a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":8,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":51252186,"name":"LONGEST SUPER FUN OBBY [901 CPs | 650 FIXED]","desc":"Minor update on October 13th, 2024:\n\n- Purchase of Skip Stage automatically teleports your player to the next stage.\n- Fixed stage 812.\n- General bug fixes.\n\nMajor update on September 12th, 2024:\n\n- Removal of broken save/load GUI. Stage progress is now automatically saved as the player progresses, eliminating the need to manually save progress and eliminating the risk of crashing or forgetting to save and losing progress.\n- Skip Stage GUI now scaled to unique screen resolution including mobile compatibility.\n- Improvements to dozens of stages, especially in the first 100.\n- New badges for stage progress (50, 100, 200, 300, 400, 500, 600, 700, and 800).\n- All broken stages fixed.","path":"/game/51252186-longest-super-fun-obby-901-cps-650-fixed","slug":"51252186-longest-super-fun-obby-901-cps-650-fixed","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ed495ac103ce1e478b1431f74596d3a1/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://scriptblox.com/images/no-script.webp","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":8,"visitor":47632827,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-08-03T02:36:37.946Z","creator":{"name":"KoolaidIsGood","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":333164326,"name":"[🎉 50M] Admin House!","desc":"A classic edition of Admin House where you must complete an obstacle course to unlock admin so that you can build, listen to music, and more! \nYou can save commands and builds (see :cmdbox and F3X :btools for the options). F3X building tools are mobile-compatible and feature multi-selecting parts (use the bottom right-hand corner button on mobile). \n\n[Version v3.5.7]:\nView full changelog by running :updatelogs ingame\n\nTo save a build, select all the items you want to save in F3X (see multi-select for mobile above). Then, press the save button. As of 6/27/2024, decals and skybox have been re-enabled in public servers. \n\nSay \":cmds\" for a list of commands. \nSay \"!rules\" to view the game's rules.\n\nSend me a PM if you run into any bugs/suggestions (or join the server below and report them there). The server link below has been updated (as of April 02, 2025)","path":"/game/333164326-50m-admin-house","slug":"333164326-50m-admin-house","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-35d888c2fe0dfb79d1a07ced17e72c9d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-1735d60811e7e228c58b895a42d2df9c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":8,"visitor":51843963,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-10-10T07:50:17.068Z","creator":{"name":"Administration Nation","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":885702956,"name":"Hmm...","desc":"","path":"/game/885702956-hmm","slug":"885702956-hmm","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-740c8ddce1175759bf8543ef6a5f99f9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":8,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":988099446,"name":"MMC Zombies Project","desc":"","path":"/game/988099446-mmc-zombies-project","slug":"988099446-mmc-zombies-project","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-eccd8ac6ddc661ceeed62ffecfaf2c13/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":8,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":2213616938,"name":"[HUGE UPDATE] FLASH UNIVERSE ⚡","desc":"","path":"/game/2213616938-huge-update-flash-universe","slug":"2213616938-huge-update-flash-universe","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-52f73097485ea09cb30a07a15934fc79/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":8,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":2921400152,"name":"Superhero Tycoon [😱 TEAMS]","desc":"","path":"/game/2921400152-superhero-tycoon-teams","slug":"2921400152-superhero-tyco